<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    Bomb costs under Combat Extended, whose bombs are items with their real weight: 227 kg for a Mk. 82, 907 kg for a
    Mk. 84. Stock, they were made from about 33 kg and 70 kg of materials. Without CE the jet loads bombs from steel,
    so each change is guarded on something only CE's patch or folder provides.

    The case is RimThunder's heavy casting (75 kg each) when that Def exists, or the same weight in steel (0.5 kg a
    unit). Real fill weights are sourced: 87 kg and 429 kg (docs/development/vehicle-patches.md). Everything else is
    AUTHORED.

    The Mk. 82 and the incendiary fall short of their weight on purpose (owner's choice, 2 Nov 2026): matching it took
    174 FSX or 858 prometheum, far too much play time to make, so chemfuel carries most of the fill. They share one
    ratio per kg of real fill: about 0.23 of the scarce ingredient and 3.5 chemfuel. Chemfuel is 0.05 kg a unit in the
    game, so the totals stay at 176 kg and 576 kg. The EMP, smoke and tox fills have no real equivalent to source.

    MarketValue is removed so the game works it out from the ingredients, its normal rule for made items
    (StatWorker_MarketValue). Change a number here to rescale a bomb.
  -->

  <!-- Mk. 82, 227 kg. Only while the Harrier's CE patch has made it the real weight; without CE this item is 12 kg. -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="FWA_Bomb500lb"]/statBases[Mass="227"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="ComponentHeavyCasting"]</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="FWA_Bomb500lb"]/costList</xpath>
            <value>
              <costList>
                <ComponentHeavyCasting>2</ComponentHeavyCasting>
                <FSX>20</FSX>
                <Chemfuel>300</Chemfuel>
                <ComponentIndustrial>2</ComponentIndustrial>
              </costList>
            </value>
          </match>
          <nomatch Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="FWA_Bomb500lb"]/costList</xpath>
            <value>
              <costList>
                <Steel>280</Steel>
                <FSX>20</FSX>
                <Chemfuel>300</Chemfuel>
                <ComponentIndustrial>2</ComponentIndustrial>
              </costList>
            </value>
          </nomatch>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="FWA_Bomb500lb"]/statBases/MarketValue</xpath>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

